            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> But didn't have luck.\n\nThat's because 'mini.pick' doesn't operate in regular mappings as it introduces its own key query process. Use [custom actions](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/f90b6b820062fc06d6d51ed61a0f9b7f9a13b01b/doc/mini-pick.txt#L595-L614) for this. But I'd still recommend using `<C-r>+` as pasting from system clipboard provider is a bit tricky.",
