        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yeah, that's actually dead easy.\n\n```lua\n  minipick.setup({\n    mappings = {\n      sys_paste = { char = \"<d-v>\", func = function() minipick.set_picker_query({ vim.fn.getreg(\"+\") }) end },\n    },\n  })\n```\n\nThanks a ton @echasnovski.",
